OL,3,GNEWSAFog cancels flights in Channel
OL,4,AIslands
OL,5,
OL,6,FFlights to and from the Channel Islands
OL,7,Fcould not land or take off for several
OL,8,Fhours on Tuesday as fog affected
OL,9,Fairports.
OL,11,FNo flights had arrived at Jersey
OL,12,FAirport since 09:24 GMT, although a
OL,13,Fplane from London Gatwick did land at
OL,14,FGuernsey Airport at 17:26.
OL,16,FNine flights to and from Jersey were
OL,17,Fcancelled, with others delayed. In
OL,18,FGuernsey, only the journey to and from
OL,19,FAlderney was cancelled.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
