OL,3,GNEWSAFog cancels flights in Channel
OL,4,AIslands
OL,5,
OL,6,FJersey Met's forecast said there was a
OL,7,F"risk of mist or hill fog, especially
OL,8,Fat first" on Tuesday night. Ports of
OL,9,FJersey said: "We advise passengers to
OL,10,Fpay close attention to communications
OL,11,Ffrom their airlines for the latest
OL,12,Fupdates."
